 R←Test_Tatin_005(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;res;folder;parms;rc;log;qdmx
⍝ Attempt to Open a project with Tatin packages via an absolute path (invalid)
⍝ The setting is rejected before Link brings in any code, with a message naming it.
⍝ It used to be noticed only when the packages were loaded, after Link.
⍝ *** WARNING: want to rename this fn? Keep in mind to rename its folder under "Tests/" as well:
⍝ ***          the test data is located via this function's own name (∆GetTestPath⊃⎕SI).
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 'TEMP'#.⎕NS'' ⋄ 'FOO'#.⎕NS''
 folder←∆GetTestPath⊃⎕SI

 parms←⎕NS''
 parms.folder←folder
 parms.watch←'ns'
 parms.ignoreUserExec←1
 parms.batch←1
 ##.Cider.C.AddAutomation'YesOrNo' 'ChangeCurrentDir@' 'n'
 :Trap 0
     (res log)←##.Cider.OpenProject parms
     →T.GoToTidyUp 1
 :Else
     qdmx←⎕DMX
     →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'"dependencies.tatin"'⍷qdmx.EM
     →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'relative to the project space'⍷qdmx.EM
 :EndTrap
 →T.GoToTidyUp(⊂'#.TEMP')∊(##.Cider.ListOpenProjects 0)[;1]   ⍝ Link was never asked

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 ##.Cider.C.Cleanup
 {}∆LINK'Break' '#.TEMP'                                ⍝ No check: when all is well it was never linked
 #.⎕EX'TEMP'
 #.⎕EX'FOO'
⍝Done
